            <field name=\\"sanitize_attributes\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_style\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_form\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"strip_style\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"strip_classes\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <group invisible=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"selection_ids\\">\\n                                        <tree editable=\\"bottom\\">\\n                                            <field name=\\"sequence\\" widget=\\"handle\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"value\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                        </tree>\\n                                    </field>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <group string=\\"Propriétés avancées\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"related\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"depends\\" required=\\"compute not in [False, '']\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"compute\\" widget=\\"code\\" options=\\"{'mode': 'python'}\\"/>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <div groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                                    <h3>Comment définir un champ calculé</h3>\\n                                    <p>Les champs calculés sont définis avec les champs\\n<strong>Dépendances</strong> et <strong>Calculer</strong>.</p>\\n                                    <p>Le champ <strong>Dépendances</strong> énumère les champs dont\\nle champ courant dépend. C'est une liste de noms de champs\\nséparés par des virgules comme <code>name, size</code>.\\nOn peut référencer des champs via d'autres champs relationnels\\npar exemple <code>partner_id.company_id.name</code>.</p>\\n                                    <p>Le champ <strong>Calculer</strong> est le code Python pour\\ncalculer la valeur du champ sur un ensemble d'enregistrements. \\nLa valeur du champ doit être attribuée à chaque enregistrement via une\\nsorte de dictionnaire.</p>\\n                                    <pre>\\n    for record in self:\\n        record['size'] = len(record.name)\\n</pre>\\n                                    <p>Les seules variables prédéfinies sont</p>\\n                                    <ul>\\n                                        <li><code>self</code> (l'ensemble d'enregistrements à calculer)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>datetime</code> (module Python)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>dateutil</code> (module Python)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>heure</code> (module Python)</li>\\n                                    </ul>\\n                                    <p>D'autres fonctionnalités sont accessibles via <code>self</code>, comme\\n<code>self.env</code>, etc.</p>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </page>\\n                            <page name=\\"groups\\" string=\\"Droits d'accès\\">\\n                                <field name=\\"groups\\"/>\\n                            </page>\\n                            <page name=\\"misc\\" string=\\"Divers\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                                <group>\\n                                    <field name=\\"state\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"modules\\"/>\\n                                </group>\\n                            </page>\\n                        </notebook>\\n                    </sheet>\\n                </form>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<form string="Fields" duplicate="false">\n                    <field name="state" invisible="1"/>\n                    <sheet>\n                        <group>\n                            <group>\n                                <field name="name"/>\n                                <field name="field_description"/>\n                                <field name="model_id" readonly="state != 'manual'"/>\n                            </group>\n                            <group>\n                                <field name="ttype"/>\n                                <field name="help"/>\n                            </group>\n                        </group>\n                        <notebook>\n                            <page name="base" string="Properties">\n                                <group string="Base Properties">\n                                    <group>\n                                        <field name="required"/>\n                                        <field name="readonly"/>\n                                        <field name="store" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                        <field name="index" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                        <field name="copied" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                    </group>\n                                    <group>\n                                        <field name="translate" invisible="ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']" readonly="ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']"/>\n                                        <field name="size" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype not in ['char', 'reference']" readonly="ttype not in ['char', 'reference']"/>\n                                        <field name="relation" invisible="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']" readonly="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']" required="ttype in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']"/>\n                                        <field name="group_expand" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype not in ['many2one', 'selection']" readonly="ttype not in ['many2one', 'selection']"/>\n                                        <field name="on_delete" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2one'" readonly="ttype != 'many2one'"/>\n                                        <field name="relation_field" invisible="ttype != 'one2many'" readonly="ttype != 'one2many'" required="ttype == 'one2many'"/>\n                                        <field name="relation_table" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'" readonly="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'"/>\n                                        <field name="column1" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'" readonly="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'"/>\n                                        <field name="column2" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'" readonly="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'"/>\n                                        <field name="domain" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']" readonly="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']"/>\n                                        <field name="currency_field" invisible="ttype != 'monetary'" readonly="ttype != 'monetary'"/>\n                                    </group>\n                                </group>\n                                <group string="HTML/Sanitization Properties">\n                                    <group>\n                                        <field name="sanitize" invisible="ttype != 'html'" readonly="ttype != 'html'"/>\n                                        <field name="sanitize_overridable" invisible="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False" readonly="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False"/>\n                                        <field name="sanitize_tags" invisible="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False" readonly="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False"/>\n                                        <field name="sanitize_attributes" invisible="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False" readonly="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False"/>\n                                    </group>\n                                    <group>\n                                        <field name="sanitize_style" invisible="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False" readonly="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False"/>\n                                        <field name="sanitize_form" invisible="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False" readonly="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False"/>\n                                        <field name="strip_style" invisible="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False" readonly="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False"/>\n                                        <field name="strip_classes" invisible="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False" readonly="ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False"/>\n                                    </group>\n                                </group>\n                                <group invisible="ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']" readonly="ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']">\n                                    <field name="selection_ids">\n                                        <tree editable="bottom">\n                                            <field name="sequence" widget="handle"/>\n                                            <field name="value"/>\n                                            <field name="name"/>\n                                        </tree>\n                                    </field>\n                                </group>\n                                <group string="Advanced Properties" groups="base.group_no_one">\n                                    <field name="related"/>\n                                    <field name="depends" required="compute not in [False, '']"/>\n                                    <field name="compute" widget="code" options="{'mode': 'python'}"/>\n                                </group>\n                                <div groups="base.group_no_one">\n                                    <h3>How to define a computed field</h3>\n                                    <p>Computed fields are defined with the fields\n                                    <strong>Dependencies</strong> and <strong>Compute</strong>.</p>\n                                    <p>The field <strong>Dependencies</strong> lists the fields that\n                                    the current field depends on. It is a comma-separated list of\n                                    field names, like <code>name, size</code>. You can also refer to\n                                    fields accessible through other relational fields, for instance\n                                    <code>partner_id.company_id.name</code>.</p>\n                                    <p>The field <strong>Compute</strong> is the Python code to\n                                    compute the value of the field on a set of records. The value of\n                                    the field must be assigned to each record with a dictionary-like\n                                    assignment.</p>\n                                    <pre>\n    for record in self:\n        record['size'] = len(record.name)\n</pre>\n                                    <p>The only predefined variables are</p>\n                                    <ul>\n                                        <li><code>self</code> (the set of records to compute)</li>\n                                        <li><code>datetime</code> (Python module)</li>\n                                        <li><code>dateutil</code> (Python module)</li>\n                                        <li><code>time</code> (Python module)</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                    <p>Other features are accessible through <code>self</code>, like\n                                    <code>self.env</code>, etc.</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </page>\n                            <page name="groups" string="Access Rights">\n                                <field name="groups"/>\n                            </page>\n                            <page name="misc" string="Miscellaneous" groups="base.group_no_one">\n                                <group>\n                                    <field name="state"/>\n                                    <field name="modules"/>\n                                </group>\n                            </page>\n                        </notebook>\n                    </sheet>\n                </form>\n            	f	t	2026-03-23 16:52:57.321964	2026-03-23 16:52:57.321964	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
