mission</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3|//h4|//h5)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Nos valeurs</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//p\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p class=\\"card-text\\">Entrez dans notre passé et assistez à la transformation d'une simple idée en une force innovante. Notre parcours, né dans un garage, reflète la puissance de la passion et du travail dur.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p class=\\"card-text\\">Notre mission consiste à créer des expériences transformatrices et de favoriser la croissance, grâce à une quête incessante d'innovation et à une volonté à dépasser les attentes.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p class=\\"card-text\\">Nos valeurs façonnent notre culture, impactent nos décisions et nous guident dans la fourniture d'un service exceptionnel. Elles reflètent notre attachement à l'intégrité, à la collaboration et à la satisfaction des clients.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n<xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">website.new_page_template_about_s_three_columns</attribute></xpath></data>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<data inherit_id="website.new_page_template_s_three_columns" primary="True">\n    <xpath expr="//h3|//h4|//h5" position="replace">\n        <h3 class="card-title">Our Story</h3>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//h3|//h4|//h5)[2]" position="replace">\n        <h3 class="card-title">Our Mission</h3>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//h3|//h4|//h5)[3]" position="replace">\n        <h3 class="card-title">Our Values</h3>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="//p" position="replace">\n        <p class="card-text">Step into our past and witness the transformation of a simple idea into an innovative force. Our journey, born in a garage, reflects the power of passion and hard work.</p>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//p)[2]" position="replace">\n        <p class="card-text">Our mission is to create transformative experiences and foster growth, driven by a relentless pursuit of innovation and a commitment to exceeding expectations.</p>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//p)[3]" position="replace">\n        <p class="card-text">Our values shape our culture, influence our decisions, and guide us in providing exceptional service. They reflect our dedication to integrity, collaboration, and client satisfaction.</p>\n    </xpath>\n<xpath expr="." position="attributes"><attribute name="t-name">website.new_page_template_about_s_three_columns</attribute></xpath></data>\n\n	f	t	2026-03-23 16:53:39.11266	2026-03-23 16:53:39.11266	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	f
930	16	929	1	1	new_page_template_landing_2_s_three_columns	\N	website.new_page_template_landing_2_s_three_columns	qweb	website/views/new_page_template_templates.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<data inherit_id=\\"website.new_page_template_landing_s_three_columns\\" primary=\\"True\\">\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//h3|//h4|//h5\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Personalized Workouts</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3|//h4|//h5)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Nutritional Guidance</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3|//h4|//h5)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Progress Tracking</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//p\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p class=\\"card-text\\">Our experienced fitness coaches design workouts that align with your goals, fitness level, and preferences.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p class=\\"card-text\\">Achieve holistic health with personalized nutritional advice that complements your workouts, promoting overall well-being.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p class=\\"card-text\\">We monitor your progress meticulously, adjusting your plan as needed to ensure continuous improvement and results.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n<xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">website.new_page_template_landing_2_s_three_columns</attribute></xpath></data>", "fr_FR": "<data inherit_id=\\"website.new_page_template_landing_s_three_columns\\" primary=\\"True\\">\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//h3|//h4|//h5\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Entraînements personnalisés</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3|//h4|//h5)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Conseils nutritionnels</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3|//h4|//h5)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Suivi de la progression</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//p\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p class=\\"card-text\\">Nos coachs sportifs expérimentés conçoivent des séances d'entraînement adaptées à vos objectifs, à votre niveau de forme et à vos préférences.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p class=\\"card-text\\">Atteignez une santé holistique grâce à des conseils nutritionnels personnalisés qui complètent vos séances d'entraînement et favorisent le bien-être général.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p class=\\"card-text\\">Nous suivons méticuleusement vos progrès, en ajustant votre plan si nécessaire, pour garantir une amélioration et des résultats continus.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n<xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">website.new_page_template_landing_2_s_three_columns</attribute></xpath></data>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<data inherit_id="website.new_page_template_landing_s_three_columns" primary="True">\n    <xpath expr="//h3|//h4|//h5" position="replace">\n        <h3 class="card-title">Personalized Workouts</h3>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//h3|//h4|//h5)[2]" position="replace">\n        <h3 class="card-title">Nutritional Guidance</h3>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//h3|//h4|//h5)[3]" position="replace">\n        <h3 class="card-title">Progress Tracking</h3>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="//p" position="replace">\n        <p class="card-text">Our experienced fitness coaches design workouts that align with your goals, fitness level, and preferences.</p>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//p)[2]" position="replace">\n        <p class="card-text">Achieve holistic health with personalized nutritional advice that complements your workouts, promoting overall well-being.</p>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//p)[3]" position="replace">\n        <p class="card-tex