         </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2 id=\\"openeducat_attendance_apps\\">Assignment</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Specify different activities which is held in an institute.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"It provides the facility to configure the assignment type.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_assignment\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_assignment\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/Assignments/assignment-type.html#assignments\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> It provides the facility to configure\\n                                        the assignment type. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_assignment == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"row mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Assign and manage\\n                                                        assignments to individual students, group of\\n                                                        students or entire batch. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_grading_bridge\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_grading_bridge\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Manage, automate, and\\n                                                        enhance the assignment grading workflow\\n                                                        seamlessly with Assignment Grading Bridge. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_grading_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_grading_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Manage and expedite the\\n                                                        assignment grading process efficiently with\\n                                                        our streamlined platform. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_rubrics\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_rubrics\\"/>\\n                                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/assignment-rubrics/rubrics-template.html#rubrics-template\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> This module allows\\n                                                        Faculty to Create Rubrics Template to grade\\n                                                        the assignments based on points or\\n                                                        percentage and manage the assignment\\n                                                        submission. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2 id=\\"openeducat_attendance_apps\\">Attendance</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Specify different activities which is held in an institute.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"It provides the Attendance maintanance facility for an institute. To maintain attendance, attendance register is created for particular batch and course\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_attendance\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_attendance\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/Attendance/attendance-register.html#attendance-register\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> It provides the Attendance maintenance\\n                                        facility for an institute. To maintain attendance,\\n                                        attendance register is created for particular batch and\\n                                        course </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_attendance == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"mt16 row\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Attendance system that\\n                                                        improves employee time tracking, scheduling,\\n                                                        and reporting. </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted mt-3\\"> Subject-specific\\n                                                        attendance will be gathered during a\\n                                                        particular session, whereas general\\n                                                        attendance will be collected by one\\n                                                        responsible faculty member for the entire\\n                                                        day. </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"attendance_subject_generic\\" widget=\\"radio\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_report_xlsx\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_report_xlsx\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Download students\\n                                                        attendace xlsx report </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_student_attendance_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_student_attendance_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> It help the student to\\n                                                        sign-in in their attendance sheet via kiosk\\n                                                        mode and barcode scanner. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_face_recognition\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_face_recognition\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Student can sign-in in\\n                                                        their attendance sheet using facial features\\n                                                        from image or video. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_student_leave_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_student_leave_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/student-leave-request/admin-student-leave.html#admin-side-configuration\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> OpenEduCat provides\\n                                                        help to enhance the overall user system by\\n                                                        providing options to send leave requests to\\n                                                        different groups or sections of people. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_student_progress_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_student_progress_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Manage studetns\\n                                                        progress report </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2>Backup</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Specify different activities which is held in an institute.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"OpenEduCat auto backup modules helps you to generate backups of your databases automatically on regular interval of times. The generated backups can be stored into local storage, FTP server, SFTP server, Dropbox, Google Drive or Onedrive.User can enable auto remove option to automatically delete old backups. User can enable email notification to be notified about the success and failure of the backup generation and storage. Using Automatic Database Backup module user can generate and store database backups to multiple location.\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup\\"/>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup\\"/>\\n                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> OpenEduCat auto backup modules\\n                                            helps you to generate backups of your databases\\n                                            automatically on regular interval of times. The\\n                                            generated backups can be stored into local storage, FTP\\n                                            server, SFTP server, Dropbox, Google Drive or Onedrive. </div>\\n                                        <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_auto_database_backup == False\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"mt16 row auto_backup_modules\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup_dropbox\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup_dropbox\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> This module allows\\n                                                            to store generated backups on Dropbox. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup_ftp\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup_ftp\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> This module allows\\n                                                            to store generated backups to remote FTP\\n                                                            server. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup_google_drive\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup_google_drive\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> This module allows\\n                                                            to store generated backups on Google\\n                                                            Drive. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup_onedrive\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup_onedrive\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> This module allows\\n                                                            to store generated backups on Onedrive. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup_sftp\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup_sftp\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> This module allows\\n                                                            to store generated backups to remote\\n                                                            SFTP server just like FTP Server, but it\\n                                                            adds a layer of security to the process. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2>Classroom</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Specify different activities which is held in an institute.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"It is used to configure the class room.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_classroom\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_classroom\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/openeducat/class-room-openeducat.html#class-room-management\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> It is used to configure the classroom. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"row mt16 content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_classroom == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"module_openeducat_classroom_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                <label for=\\"module_openeducat_classroom_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Organize and manage\\n                                                    classrooms with equipment and facilities\\n                                                    required for giving best classroom sessions. </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                        <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"\\">\\n                         