div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_notice_board_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/notice-board/notice-board-admin.html#how-to-configure-notice\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Publier un avis et une circulaire. </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il s’agit de prise de rendez-vous en ligne.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_online_appointment\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_online_appointment\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/online-appointment/how-to-create.html#how-to-create-online-appointment\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il s’agit de prise de rendez-vous en ligne. </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il s'agit de vérifier les feuilles d'examen OMR à l'aide d'un mobile.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_omr\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_omr\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il s'agit de vérifier les feuilles d'examen OMR\\n à l'aide de Mobile. </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il vous permet de stocker les coordonnées des parents.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_parent\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_parent\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/parent/parent-details.html#parent\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il vous permet de stocker les détails\\n des Parents. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_parent == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"module_openeducat_parent_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                <label for=\\"module_openeducat_parent_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Offrez une meilleure transparence\\n à un parent sur les activités et les réalisations académiques\\n de son enfant. </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" id=\\"placement_enterprise\\" title=\\"Il vous permet de stocker les détails de l'équipe de placement, de son chef d'équipe et des membres de son équipe.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_placement_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_placement_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/how-to-configure/how-to.html?highlight=placement#how-to-configure\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il vous permet de stocker les détails de\\n l'équipe de placement, de son chef d'équipe et des membres de son équipe. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_placement_enterprise == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"module_openeducat_placement_job_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                <label for=\\"module_openeducat_placement_job_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/how-to-configure/how-to.html?highlight=placement#job-post\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il fournit des installations de placement\\n pour les étudiants. </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Configurez différents types de bourses.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_scholarship_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_scholarship_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/openeducat/basic-openeducat.html?highlight=scholarship#configure-scholarship-types\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Configurez différents types de bourses. </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il générera un code QR sécurisé.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_secure\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\" id=\\"secure_qr\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_secure\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/secure/secure-configuration.html#configuration\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il générera un code QR sécurisé. </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il est utilisé pour configurer la catégorie de compétences.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_skill_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_skill_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/student-skill-assessment/student-skill-assessment.html#student-skill-assessment\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il est utilisé pour configurer la catégorie de compétence\\n. </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_subject_material_allocation\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_subject_material_allocation\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérez une allocation efficace des matières\\n grâce à notre système rationalisé. </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"La configuration des itinéraires de transport vous aide à fournir les données de démarrage de chaque itinéraire.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_transportation_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_transportation_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/transportation/transportation-routes.html#configure-routes\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> La configuration des itinéraires dans\\n le transport vous aide à fournir les données de démarrage de\\n chaque itinéraire. </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2 id=\\"openeducat_attendance_apps\\">Admission</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Précisez les différentes activités qui se déroulent dans un institut.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il est utilisé pour la procédure d'admission du candidat.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_admission\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_admission\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/enrollment/enrollment-admission-register.html#admission-registers\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il est utilisé pour la procédure d'admission du candidat. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_admission == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"row mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_admission_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_admission_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Manage Students\\n                                                        Admission </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_mass_subject_registration\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_mass_subject_registration\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérer Les étudiants peuvent ajouter\\n plusieurs sujets </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_online_admission\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_online_admission\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérer un processus d'admission en ligne rationalisé et\\n convivial </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2 id=\\"openeducat_attendance_apps\\">Anciens élèves</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Précisez les différentes activités qui se déroulent dans un institut.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il vous permet de stocker les coordonnées des anciens étudiants.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_alumni_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_alumni_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/alumni/alumni-group-details.html#alumni-group\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il vous permet de stocker les détails des\\n anciens étudiants. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_alumni_enterprise == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"row mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_alumni_blog_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_alumni_blog_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Délivrez et partagez\\n des connaissances avec tout le monde en créant\\n des blogs bien informés et conçus par des étudiants\\n ou des professeurs. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_alumni_event_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_alumni_event_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Organisez des événements,\\n publiez des informations et des images sur les événements, envoyez\\n RSVP aux participants et comptez ceux qui\\n ont participé. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_alumni_job_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_alumni_job_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module permet\\n aux anciens élèves de créer des offres d'emploi. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2 id=\\"openeducat_attendance_apps\\">Affectation</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Précisez les différentes activités qui se déroulent dans un institut.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il offre la possibilité de configurer le type d'affectation.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_assignment\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_assignment\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/Assignments/assignment-type.html#assignments\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il offre la possibilité de configurer\\n le type d'affectation. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_assignment == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"row mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Attribuez et gérez des devoirs à des étudiants individuels, à un groupe d'étudiants ou à un groupe entier. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_grading_bridge\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_grading_bridge\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérez, automatisez et\\n améliorez le flux de travail de notation des devoirs\\n de manière transparente avec Assignment Grading Bridge. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_grading_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_grading_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérez et accélérez efficacement le\\n processus de notation des devoirs avec\\n notre plateforme rationalisée. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_rubrics\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_assignment_rubrics\\"/>\\n                                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/assignment-rubrics/rubrics-template.html#rubrics-template\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module permet\\n aux professeurs de créer un modèle de grilles d'évaluation pour noter\\n les devoirs en fonction de points ou\\n de pourcentages et de gérer la soumission\\n des devoirs. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2 id=\\"openeducat_attendance_apps\\">Présence</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Précisez les différentes activités qui se déroulent dans un institut.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il fournit les services de maintenance des présences pour un institut. Pour maintenir la fréquentation, un registre de présence est créé pour un lot et un cours particuliers.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_attendance\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_attendance\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/Attendance/attendance-register.html#attendance-register\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il fournit la fonction de gestion des présences\\n pour un institut. Pour maintenir la fréquentation,\\n un registre de présence est créé pour un lot et\\n un cours particulier. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_attendance == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"mt16 row\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Système de présence qui\\n améliore le suivi du temps, la planification et le reporting des employés. </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted mt-3\\"> La fréquentation spécifique à une matière sera collectée au cours d'une session particulière, tandis que la fréquentation générale sera collectée par un membre du corps professoral responsable pour la journée entière. </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"attendance_subject_generic\\" widget=\\"radio\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_report_xlsx\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_report_xlsx\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Télécharger le rapport xlsx de présence des étudiants </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_student_attendance_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_student_attendance_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il aide l'étudiant à\\n se connecter à sa feuille de présence via le mode kiosque\\n et le scanner de codes-barres. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_face_recognition\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_attendance_face_recognition\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> L'étudiant peut se connecter\\n à sa feuille de présence en utilisant les traits du visage\\n à partir d'une image ou d'une vidéo. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_student_leave_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_student_leave_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/student-leave-request/admin-student-leave.html#admin-side-configuration\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> OpenEduCat fournit\\n une aide pour améliorer le système utilisateur global en\\n fournissant des options pour envoyer des demandes de congé à\\n différents groupes ou sections de personnes. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_student_progress_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_student_progress_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérer le rapport d'avancement des étudiants </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2>Sauvegarde</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Précisez les différentes activités qui se déroulent dans un institut.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Les modules de sauvegarde automatique OpenEduCat vous aident à générer automatiquement des sauvegardes de vos bases de données à intervalles réguliers. Les sauvegardes générées peuvent être stockées sur un stockage local, un serveur FTP, un serveur SFTP, Dropbox, Google Drive ou Onedrive. L'utilisateur peut activer l'option de suppression automatique pour supprimer automatiquement les anciennes sauvegardes. L'utilisateur peut activer la notification par courrier électronique pour être informé du succès et de l'échec de la génération et du stockage de la sauvegarde. À l’aide du module de sauvegarde automatique de la base de données, l’utilisateur peut générer et stocker des sauvegardes de base de données sur plusieurs emplacements.\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup\\"/>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup\\"/>\\n                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Les modules de sauvegarde automatique OpenEduCat\\n vous aident à générer automatiquement des sauvegardes de vos bases de données\\n à intervalles réguliers. Les sauvegardes\\n générées peuvent être stockées sur un stockage local, un serveur FTP\\n, un serveur SFTP, Dropbox, Google Drive ou Onedrive. </div>\\n                                        <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_auto_database_backup == False\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"mt16 row auto_backup_modules\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup_dropbox\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup_dropbox\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module permet\\n de stocker les sauvegardes générées sur Dropbox. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup_ftp\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup_ftp\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module permet\\n de stocker les sauvegardes générées sur un serveur FTP\\n distant. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup_google_drive\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup_google_drive\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module permet\\n de stocker les sauvegardes générées sur Google\\n Drive. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup_onedrive\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup_onedrive\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module permet\\n de stocker les sauvegardes générées sur Onedrive. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_auto_database_backup_sftp\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_auto_database_backup_sftp\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module permet\\n de stocker les sauvegardes générées sur un serveur SFTP distant, tout comme le serveur FTP, mais il\\n ajoute une couche de sécurité au processus. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2>Salle de classe</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Précisez les différentes activités qui se déroulent dans un institut.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il est utilisé pour configurer la salle de classe.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_classroom\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_classroom\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/openeducat/class-room-openeducat.html#class-room-management\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il est utilisé pour configurer la classe. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"row mt16 content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_classroom == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"module_openeducat_classroom_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                <label for=\\"module_openeducat_classroom_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Organiser et gérer\\n les salles de classe avec l'équipement et les installations\\n nécessaires pour offrir les meilleures sessions en classe. </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                        <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"module_openeducat_live\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                <label for=\\"module_openeducat_live\\"/>\\n                                                <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> La classe en direct est livrée avec\\n un ensemble dynamique d'outils d'enseignement et d'apprentissage pour\\n simuler un environnement d'apprentissage physique en classe. </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                        <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"module_openeducat_live_assignment\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                <label for=\\"module_openeducat_live_assignment\\"/>\\n                                                <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Les professeurs peuvent utiliser la session en direct\\n pour créer, modifier et attribuer des tâches\\n d'équipe et individuelles. </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                        <div class=\\"mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"module_openeducat_live_attendance\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                <label for=\\"module_openeducat_live_attendance\\"/>\\n                                                <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Present rend la prise de présence rapide, précise et facile. Obtenez une vue claire\\n de l'ensemble de votre classe. </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                        <div class=\\"mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"module_openeducat_live_attentiveness\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                <label for=\\"module_openeducat_live_attentiveness\\"/>\\n                                                <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Participez aux discussions\\n en classe en partageant des points de vue, en posant\\n des questions et en contribuant aux projets de groupe. </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2 id=\\"openeducat_attendance_apps\\">Examen</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Précisez les différentes activités qui se déroulent dans un institut.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il offre la possibilité de configurer les détails liés à l'examen, tels que les types d'examen et les salles d'examen.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_exam\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_exam\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/exam/exam-configuration.html#configure-exam\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il offre la possibilité de configurer\\n les détails liés à l'examen, tels que les types d'examen et les salles d'examen. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_exam == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"row mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_exam_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_exam_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Planifiez un examen\\n via diverses méthodes telles que CCE, CPA et\\n bien plus encore en quelques clics. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_exam_gpa_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_exam_gpa_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérez et optimisez le\\n processus de notation et d'évaluation avec Exam GPA\\n Enterprise. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_exam_grading_bridge\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_exam_grading_bridge\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérez et rationalisez\\n le processus de notation des examens de manière transparente grâce à\\n l'Innovant Exam Grading Bridge. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2 id=\\"openeducat_attendance_apps\\">Frais</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Précisez les différentes activités qui se déroulent dans un institut.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"La configuration des frais vous aide à fournir les données de démarrage des frais en fonction des cours d'un institut.\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_fees\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_fees\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/openeducat/fees-openeducat.html?highlight=fees#fees-management\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> La configuration des frais vous aide à\\n fournir les données de démarrage des frais en fonction des cours\\n d'un institut. </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_fees == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"row mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_fees_plan\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_fees_plan\\"/>\\n                                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/openeducat/fees-openeducat.html?highlight=fees#configure-fees\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module vous ajoute\\n une fonctionnalité permettant de créer une facture pour la collecte des frais. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_fees_parent_bridge\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_fees_parent_bridge\\" string=\\"Tarifs Accès pour les parents\\"/>\\n                                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/openeducat/fees-openeducat.html?highlight=fees#fees-on-duration\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module permet\\n aux parents d'accéder aux détails des frais de leurs\\n enfants. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2 id=\\"openeducat_attendance_apps\\">Bibliothèque</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Précisez les différentes activités qui se déroulent dans un institut.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Il offre la possibilité de configurer la gestion de la bibliothèque\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_library\\"/>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_library\\"/>\\n                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/library/library-configuration.html#library-configuration\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Il offre la possibilité de configurer\\n la gestion de la bibliothèque </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_library == False\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"row mt16\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_library_barcode\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_library_barcode\\"/>\\n                                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/library/library-barcode.html#barcode-scanning\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Le code-barres centralisé\\n a permis la gestion intégrée de la bibliothèque. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_library_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_library_enterprise\\"/>\\n                                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/library/library-configuration.html#library-configuration\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérez des livres, des articles,\\n des médias et bien plus encore </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                    <field name=\\"module_openeducat_digital_library\\"/>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                    <label for=\\"module_openeducat_digital_library\\"/>\\n                                                    <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/digital-library/category.html#how-to-create-category\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module ajoute la\\n fonctionnalité de bibliothèque numérique pour lire des livres dans\\n OpenEduCat. </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <h2>LMS</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt16 o_settings_container\\" title=\\"Précisez les différentes activités qui se déroulent dans un institut.\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-lg-12 o_setting_box\\" title=\\"Le système de gestion de l'apprentissage OpenEduCat vous aide à créer votre cours en ligne. Créez-y vos sections et votre matériel de cours.\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                        <field name=\\"module_openeducat_lms\\"/>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                        <label for=\\"module_openeducat_lms\\"/>\\n                                        <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/lms/lms-course.html#course\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Le système de gestion de l'apprentissage OpenEduCat\\n vous aide à créer votre cours en ligne. Créez\\n vos sections et votre matériel de cours. </div>\\n                                        <div class=\\"content-group\\" invisible=\\"module_openeducat_lms == False\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"mt16 row\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_openeducat_lms_admission\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_openeducat_lms_admission\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérez les inscriptions\\n sans effort avec LMS Admission. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_openeducat_lms_blog\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_openeducat_lms_blog\\"/>\\n                                                        <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/lms/lms-blog.html#blog\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Délivrez et partagez\\n des connaissances avec tout le monde en créant\\n des blogs bien informés et conçus par\\n des étudiants ou des professeurs. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_openeducat_lms_forum\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_openeducat_lms_forum\\"/>\\n                                                        <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/lms/lms-forum.html#forum\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module ajoute\\n la fonctionnalité de forum dans le système de gestion\\n d'apprentissage à OpenEduCat. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_openeducat_lms_gamification\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_openeducat_lms_gamification\\"/>\\n                                                        <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/lms/lms-gamification.html#gamification\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Ce module ajoute\\n la fonctionnalité de gamification dans le système de gestion\\n de l'apprentissage à OpenEduCat. </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_left_pane\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"module_openeducat_lms_h5p\\"/>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                    <div class=\\"o_setting_right_pane\\">\\n                                                        <label for=\\"module_openeducat_lms_h5p\\"/>\\n                                                        <a href=\\"https://doc.openeducat.org/applications/lms/lms-course.html#h5p\\" title=\\"Documentation\\" class=\\"o_doc_link\\" target=\\"_blank\\"/>\\n                                                        <div class=\\"text-muted\\"> Gérez du contenu interactif\\n et engageant de manière transparente avec LMS\\n H5P </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb16\\">\\n        